WEBVTT

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:15.070
Adjustments are complete.

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:18.110
They are your faithful soldiers.

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:20.610
Please use them as you see fit.

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:30.410
Steady yourself, President Souraku.

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:33.230
It is too late to stop this now.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:38.570
You're right. Yes, I can't stop this now.

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:40.470
Then...

00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:47.650
Yukari...

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:18.900
<b>Katana Maidens</b>

00:02:19.940 --> 00:02:25.360
<b>Episode 18  Aradama Domination</b>

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:30.910
This is really strict.

00:02:30.910 --> 00:02:36.410
If Princess Tagitsu shows up again, 
it will most likely be here.

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:38.460
Mai...

00:02:39.270 --> 00:02:40.840
What is it, Sayaka-chan?

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:44.720
Do you think Princess Tagitsu will come?

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:51.680
Then we'll...

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:56.100
...probably have another fight,
 like last time.

00:02:57.630 --> 00:02:59.610
Sayaka-chan, here!

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:07.200
Remember what Kanami-chan 
and Hiyori-chan told us

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.840
when they got back from seeing Yukari-sama?

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:14.310
While Princess Tagitsu is indeed gaining 
strength with the noro she's collected,

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:16.290
we can still deal with her.

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:19.630
Is there something else that's worrying you?

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:24.080
If we became allies with Princess 
Takiri and Princess Ichikishima,

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:26.300
could they talk to Princess Tagitsu?

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:27.310
Huh?

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:28.730
Kaoru told me...

00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:34.010
To really think about things before fighting.

00:03:39.770 --> 00:03:41.360
Why are you patting me?

00:03:42.010 --> 00:03:43.440
I wonder why.

00:03:45.130 --> 00:03:48.900
But if we could really do that,

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:51.530
we might not have to fight at all.

00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:59.730
Why don't we just kill
Princess Takiri and the rest of 'em?

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:01.540
Come on now, are you serious?

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:04.880
Should a Mashiko Toji really 
be saying something so hasty?

00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:09.250
I'm joking, but given how the other side is 
really difficult to talk things through with,

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:11.430
it makes me want to be a 
little serious about that.

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:15.570
Akane-sama is negotiating with 
Princess Takiri again today.

00:04:15.570 --> 00:04:17.100
I wonder how it will turn out.

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:22.310
Foolish mortals! Obey me!

00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:26.190
Princess Takiri is pretty 
overwhelming, though.

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:29.820
She completely looks down on us humans.

00:04:29.820 --> 00:04:31.150
That's true.

00:04:31.150 --> 00:04:34.830
If we joined forces with Princess Takiri
 and defeated Princess Tagitsu,

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:38.250
then Princess Takiri might 
just end up our enemy.

00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:39.870
But still...

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:42.770
As long as the possibility 
to join hands still exists,

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:45.250
we won't let them have Princess Takiri.

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:48.380
Don't underestimate the 400 
years history of Mashiko Toji.

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:52.080
That's why I love you, Kaoru.

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:54.850
Oh, jeez... You're so annoying.

00:04:55.510 --> 00:04:57.850
That reminds me, have you seen Nene?

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:02.140
Didn't he go off to play with 
Maki-maki and Hana-hana?

00:05:02.140 --> 00:05:05.060
Maki-maki is even more impressive 
when she undresses.

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:09.030
I'm sure she's hiding a big bust 
underneath those wrappings.

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:13.280
Is something the matter, Maki-san?

00:05:13.590 --> 00:05:16.270
No, I just suddenly felt a chill.

00:05:16.270 --> 00:05:18.160
Please hang in there.

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:21.760
When the time to attack comes, it is 
our duty to cut through the vanguard.

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:24.750
The vanguard, huh?

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:28.800
They won't let us do normal security,
in order to keep things confidential.

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:31.810
And we're given permission to fight only 
when the enemy is going to attack.

00:05:32.410 --> 00:05:34.510
Doesn't that just make us the bullets?

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:40.480
Well, we can't say that
we don't deserve this treatment.

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:43.480
Trust can only be regained through action.

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:45.550
Yeah, you're right.

00:05:45.550 --> 00:05:48.670
That's what we've decided to do, you and I.

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:53.300
And not just Princess Tagitsu.

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:55.570
We also need to stop Yomi 
and President Takatsu,

00:05:55.570 --> 00:05:58.180
who are working together at Ayanokouji.

00:05:58.180 --> 00:05:59.870
We don't have time to be depressed.

00:06:00.970 --> 00:06:05.250
In that case, fortifying yourself 
with food is also your job.

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:11.260
I recommend the pickles that have
been heated along with everything else.

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:14.450
You're a rich girl, aren't you?

00:06:20.110 --> 00:06:22.970
I must ask you once more.

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:26.640
Will you please lend us your power?

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:28.020
Princess Takiri,

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:31.620
if you agree to fight with 
us against Princess Tagitsu,

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:35.070
that would bring us one step closer

00:06:35.070 --> 00:06:38.410
to your wish of humans 
and aradama coexisting.

00:06:39.110 --> 00:06:40.160
Insolence.

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:47.090
I do not wish to fight alongside
 you humans. I seek your servitude.

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:50.750
Give me Princess Ichikishima.

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:54.550
Do so, and I will permit you 
to live under my protection.

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:58.430
Please wait. Is that what 
you meant by "coexisting"?

00:06:58.430 --> 00:06:59.550
Naturally.

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:05.000
The immature species called humans 
are the same as the bugs and the beasts.

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:08.430
I will guide them in a better direction

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:10.810
and only then will we truly coexist.

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:15.040
We have heard enough, Akane-sama.

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:16.200
Juujou-san...

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:18.550
Now we have affirmation.

00:07:18.550 --> 00:07:21.930
She is just another aradama, 
like Princess Tagitsu.

00:07:21.930 --> 00:07:24.290
She does not wish to coexist with us.

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:31.040
Excuse me, Princess Takiri-san!
 Will you have a sword fight with me?

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:34.800
Kanami, this isn't the time for that.

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:37.500
What are your intentions, Chidori?

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:42.860
Y-You have never seen us before.

00:07:42.860 --> 00:07:45.930
That's why you're not 
able to meet us halfway.

00:07:46.890 --> 00:07:50.260
And, well, I thought that if we both 
got a good look at each other,

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:56.630
we'd be able to understand one 
another better—human and aradama.

00:07:56.630 --> 00:08:01.980
And you think facing her directly with your 
okatana is the fastest way to do that?

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:06.540
Leave.

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:11.590
That didn't work.

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:12.940
Of course it didn't.

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:16.150
But that was very like you.

00:08:16.150 --> 00:08:20.080
Indeed, it was a rather outlandish request,

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:21.890
but there are parts of it I agree with.

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:23.760
Akane-sama?

00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:29.180
We will continue to meet with her 
until we can ascertain her character.

00:08:29.180 --> 00:08:30.220
Okay!

00:08:33.210 --> 00:08:36.890
Get a good look... to understand...?

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:40.210
You may come out.

00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:44.290
Aradama?

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:48.940
No, it was once an aradama, but it 
has lost its necessary impurity.

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:54.620
An aradama and yet not. What are you?

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:06.060
What do you want with my chest?

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:18.030
While you may not be impure,
 why have the humans left you alone?

00:10:03.390 --> 00:10:08.060
So you were also born from humankind's 
ignorance and foolishness?

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:12.160
But why do you not have any impurities?

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:27.640
You really did a number on this place.

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:29.940
<i>A Toji of that time period?</i>

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:33.890
Stop making such a giant mess of things 
in Mashiko territory, you damn aradama.

00:10:43.050 --> 00:10:45.860
Aradama just make things hard.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:51.390
If you want to let loose once in a while, 
I'll be your opponent.

00:10:51.390 --> 00:10:52.620
Let's do it again.

00:10:57.240 --> 00:10:58.630
This person...

00:11:14.550 --> 00:11:16.560
These people...

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:29.120
Do you mean these people got rid of it?

00:11:31.050 --> 00:11:37.250
The impurity inside you 
took many, many years...

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:45.900
You shouldn't have been able to 
cleanse the noro or the impurity.

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:50.430
But the humans managed to do so.

00:11:51.180 --> 00:11:54.670
As a species, they are imperfect 
beings with short lives,

00:11:54.670 --> 00:11:58.700
but with such a simple method as 
living alongside them for so long...

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:02.150
Is such a thing even possible?

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:05.440
Such a miraculous possibility?

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:09.040
And, well, I thought that if we both 
got a good look at each other,

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:15.370
we'd be able to understand one 
another better—human and aradama.

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:27.390
What is it, Nene-chan?

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:31.980
You want me to go with you?

00:12:46.890 --> 00:12:52.750
Will you not draw? You said that 
you wanted to spar with me.

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:54.720
Okay!

00:13:27.150 --> 00:13:29.430
Th-Thank you!

00:13:29.430 --> 00:13:32.780
I feel like I can really see you now.

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:36.210
I have been here all along.

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:37.780
Th-That's not what I meant.

00:13:37.780 --> 00:13:43.620
Um, um... you seem kind 
of like a gentle ocean?

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:44.750
Ocean?

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:48.900
It's big and vast and seems 
like it could accept anything.

00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:50.960
That includes humans and aradama.

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:54.220
I can't really explain it very well, though.

00:13:57.970 --> 00:14:03.060
E-Excuse me, how did you 
see my sword—I mean, me?

00:14:05.230 --> 00:14:08.780
Chidori girl, you are...

00:14:17.070 --> 00:14:19.050
Yes... Yes.

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:20.580
Understood.

00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:23.810
What's going on, Mai?

00:14:23.810 --> 00:14:25.470
What did Sana-sensei say?

00:14:25.470 --> 00:14:28.590
A large number of aradama have 
appeared around Ichigaya.

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:30.840
They're attacking civilians indiscriminately.

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:33.540
Seriously? What are we going to do?

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:35.470
We can't leave this matter alone.

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:38.000
But our mission...

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:40.860
Don't get flustered!

00:14:41.390 --> 00:14:45.670
Yes, this is nothing more 
than an obvious diversion.

00:14:45.670 --> 00:14:46.650
But!

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:49.050
Maki-san and I will go.

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:52.530
An old friend is coming.

00:14:56.490 --> 00:15:00.510
It's aggravating, but the elite guard
 is better than nothing.

00:15:00.510 --> 00:15:02.870
It's reassuring, having them on our side.

00:15:02.870 --> 00:15:04.770
If this is a diversion...

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:08.250
Everyone, get the S Equipment 
ready! As soon as possible!

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:16.000
Damn it! Now what's going on?

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:17.150
This is the actual attack.

00:15:17.150 --> 00:15:19.120
Everyone! I'm sorry!

00:15:19.120 --> 00:15:20.460
You're late, Kanami!

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:27.250
Those are Toji from Ayanokouji?

00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:30.000
Then they're part of 
Princess Tagitsu's attack?

00:15:32.480 --> 00:15:33.840
Ayumu-chan!

00:15:33.840 --> 00:15:36.360
Huh? Why? Why is Ayumu-chan fighting?

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:41.620
Do you have any idea what 
you guys are doing?!

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:43.430
There's no point, Hiyoyon!

00:15:43.430 --> 00:15:47.000
These girls aren't going to 
listen to a thing you say.

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:49.960
Etou-san! It's the real Etou-san!

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:56.340
What's with this power? It's too much, 
even with the Storm Armor equipped.

00:15:56.340 --> 00:15:57.890
Please watch me.

00:15:57.890 --> 00:16:01.850
I can finally do that 
technique you showed me!

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:10.400
Ayumu-chan, tell me! Why?

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:14.360
So please show me more and more, Etou-san!

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:17.740
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:21.240
We have to push them
 back somehow. Beyond this is—

00:16:21.670 --> 00:16:24.240
I know, but... man!

00:16:27.740 --> 00:16:30.890
I've kept you waiting, Princess Takiri.

00:16:40.440 --> 00:16:42.420
It's been a while, Yomi.

00:16:42.420 --> 00:16:44.760
I'm glad you're well.

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:47.640
So you did come, after all.

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:52.530
Come back. You don't have to do what 
President Takatsu tells you to anymore.

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:54.980
Yukari-sama is in good health.

00:16:54.980 --> 00:16:57.900
Let us loyally serve as 
her elite guard once more.

00:16:59.900 --> 00:17:02.630
Yomi... laughed?

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:04.530
Is there something funny?

00:17:04.860 --> 00:17:10.430
Well, neither of you understand anything.

00:17:15.350 --> 00:17:17.730
We don't need to hold back, then.

00:17:18.650 --> 00:17:20.440
We will stop you.

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:24.480
We won't let you or anyone 
else meet an end like Yume did!

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:32.940
Ayumu-chan...

00:17:33.230 --> 00:17:36.480
Come, let's fight some more, Etou-san.

00:17:36.940 --> 00:17:39.380
We're in a bind here, Hiyoyon. Do something.

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:40.690
This isn't the time for your crap!

00:17:41.150 --> 00:17:42.780
She's coming, Mai!

00:17:48.990 --> 00:17:50.200
Princess Tagitsu?

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:53.960
It's been a while, my other half.

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:57.810
Princess Takiri!

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:03.720
So this is your answer, then?

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:09.350
I have decided that losing humankind's 
possibilities would be regrettable.

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:10.310
Fool!

00:18:18.690 --> 00:18:19.610
Takiri—

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:21.570
Move aside, Ayumu-chan!

00:18:21.570 --> 00:18:24.180
We're finally able to fight together.

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:27.620
I've finally reached your level!

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:30.630
Princess Takiri!

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:35.240
In theory, there is no 
difference in our strength.

00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:42.340
But this is the result of the humans
 needing you and not needing me.

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:46.680
Princess Takiri!

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:49.070
Please wait!

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:53.740
Now, return to my body.

00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:10.910
Princess Takiri?

00:19:12.620 --> 00:19:16.580
So that is what you look like, Chidori girl.

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:17.970
Princess Takiri!

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:24.960
I saw you flying freely.

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:29.840
Just like the other name of that sword...

00:19:30.470 --> 00:19:33.040
...you can even cut through lightning.

00:19:33.590 --> 00:19:35.580
Fly, humans.

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:40.700
Fast, high, and far...

00:19:49.130 --> 00:19:50.780
Princess Takiri...

00:19:54.070 --> 00:19:57.750
That's better. Now, then...

00:20:03.020 --> 00:20:04.270
Mai...

00:20:04.270 --> 00:20:06.210
We have to get up!

00:20:07.980 --> 00:20:10.340
Hey, can you still use your utsushi?

00:20:10.340 --> 00:20:14.100
I could get used to this.

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:36.550
Oh? So this is the thing from 
Princess Takiri's memories?

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:39.410
I see. How amusing.

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:45.900
What a surprise.

00:20:45.900 --> 00:20:50.010
I would have never expected such 
an aradama to be tamed by humans.

00:20:51.190 --> 00:20:52.340
Nene-chan...

00:20:59.430 --> 00:21:01.440
Nene! Stop it!

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:04.900
Such a heartwarming treat! 
I'll thoroughly enjoy it.

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:20.250
Princess Tagitsu!

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:25.600
Little crow, you all have lost

00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:28.700
your best future along with Princess Takiri.

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:34.090
You should at least relax and look 
forward to me bringing about your end.

00:21:47.820 --> 00:21:51.090
Nene, you idiot...

00:23:34.840 --> 00:23:39.840
<b>Next Episode Call of the Evil God</b>
